
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALARY-CALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EMP-ID       PIC 9(5).
01 BASIC-SALARY PIC 9(7)V99.
01 HRA          PIC 9(7)V99.
01 DA           PIC 9(7)V99.
01 DEDUCTION    PIC 9(7)V99.
01 GROSS-SALARY PIC 9(7)V99.
01 NET-SALARY   PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "ENTER EMPLOYEE ID: "
    ACCEPT EMP-ID

    DISPLAY "ENTER BASIC SALARY: "
    ACCEPT BASIC-SALARY

    COMPUTE HRA = BASIC-SALARY * 0.20
    COMPUTE DA = BASIC-SALARY * 0.10
    COMPUTE DEDUCTION = BASIC-SALARY * 0.05

    COMPUTE GROSS-SALARY =
        BASIC-SALARY + HRA + DA

    COMPUTE NET-SALARY =
        GROSS-SALARY - DEDUCTION

    DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE ID: " EMP-ID
    DISPLAY "BASIC SALARY: " BASIC-SALARY
    DISPLAY "HRA: " HRA
    DISPLAY "DA: " DA
    DISPLAY "DEDUCTION: " DEDUCTION
    DISPLAY "GROSS SALARY: " GROSS-SALARY
    DISPLAY "NET SALARY: " NET-SALARY

    STOP RUN.
